<section data-wf-component-id="b1033944-fb24-9763-fe93-c0d4cf2dd2e4" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section page-bg">
      <div class="section-gap large">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="faq-v2-grid">
            <div class="faq-v2-left">
              <div class="teatimonial-header">
                <div class="section-badge">
                  <div class="section-badge-mark"></div>
                  <p class="font-label">FAQ</p>
                </div>
                <h2 class="section-heading-small">Question &amp; answer</h2>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="expert-v2-card"><img src="/images/Image-Design-yours-11.webp" alt="Portrait of a woman with light skin and blue eyes wearing a white turtleneck and a brown coat against a plain light gray background." sizes="(max-width: 1476px) 100vw, 1476px" srcset="/images/Image-Design-yours-11-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Image-Design-yours-11-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Image-Design-yours-11-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Image-Design-yours-11.webp 1476w" class="expert-avatar" />
                <div class="expert-v2-row">
                  <div class="text-stack tight">
                    <p class="font-regular">Let's help you</p>
                    <p class="text-regular">Talk to an Expert</p>
                  </div>
                  <a href="/contact-us" class="expert-v2-button w-inline-block">
                    <div class="blog-arrow-pill"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="arrow">
                        <path d="M18.5 11.998L5 11.998" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M13.0001 5.998C13.0001 5.998 19 10.417 19 11.9981C19 13.5792 13 17.998 13 17.998" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="arrow">
                        <path d="M18.5 11.998L5 11.998" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        <path d="M13.0001 5.998C13.0001 5.998 19 10.417 19 11.9981C19 13.5792 13 17.998 13 17.998" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-v2-list">
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-v2-item">
                <div class="faq-v2-head">
                  <p class="font-extra-normal">What if I only need interior design help for one project?</p>
                  <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 2" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                      <path d="M18.8438 0.84375H0.84375" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                      <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-summary">That is fine. Single projects are quoted on their own scope, with a fixed fee and a clear end date set.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-v2-item">
                <div class="faq-v2-head">
                  <p class="font-extra-normal">What makes our interior design agency stand out from the rest?</p>
                  <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 2" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                      <path d="M18.8438 0.84375H0.84375" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                      <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-summary">One team from the first sketch to the last handle, so architecture and interiors are resolved together.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-v2-item">
                <div class="faq-v2-head">
                  <p class="font-extra-normal">Can I submit unlimited interior design requests?</p>
                  <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 2" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                      <path d="M18.8438 0.84375H0.84375" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                      <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-summary">Yes. Send as many as you like; we work through the queue in your order, one request active at a time.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-v2-item">
                <div class="faq-v2-head">
                  <p class="font-extra-normal">Can I really request unlimited interior design services?</p>
                  <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 2" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                      <path d="M18.8438 0.84375H0.84375" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                      <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-summary">Yes. There is no monthly cap on requests, we simply keep one in progress so each gets full attention.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-v2-item">
                <div class="faq-v2-head">
                  <p class="font-extra-normal">How quickly will I get my interior design concepts?</p>
                  <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 2" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                      <path d="M18.8438 0.84375H0.84375" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                      <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-summary">First concepts within five working days of sign-off, revisions back in two, and you see every stage.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-v2-item">
                <div class="faq-v2-head">
                  <p class="font-extra-normal">Are there any limits to the number of interior design requests I can make?</p>
                  <div class="faq-v2-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 2" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                      <path d="M18.8438 0.84375H0.84375" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                      <path d="M13.5 4.5V22.5M22.5 13.5H4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-summary">No cap on the total. Your plan sets how many run at once, and you can reorder the queue at any time.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
